     $$ d_i = \sqrt{(x_i - x_{cam})^2 + (y_i - y_{cam})^2} $$
-    Where $(x_{cam}, y_{cam})$ is the camera's position in the $xy$ plane.
-3.  Sort the cells in ascending order of $d_i$ (closest to furthest).
